# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# biome.json sets lineEnding: "lf", so with core.autocrlf=true on Windows a
# plain git checkout produces a CRLF working tree that iome check then
# reports as ~50 format errors. Linux CI checks out LF, so the gate passes
# there and fails only locally — which makes the local gate untrustworthy
# rather than merely noisy.
* text=auto eol=lf